abstract: >-
  Research software for controlled studies of how bounded video-memory context should be
  packaged across temporal rate, spatial resolution and depth, with construct-valid frame,
  persistent-object and reach-differential evaluation.
keywords:
  - video prediction
  - hierarchical memory
  - context packaging
  - long-horizon generation
  - reproducible research
